{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39704","headline":"寄同年崔学士 · 黄滔","name":"寄同年崔学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半因同醉杏花园，尘忝鸿鑪与铸颜。\n已脱素衣酬素发，敢持青桂爱青山。\n虽知珠树悬天上，终赖银河接世间。\n毕使海涯能拔宅，三秦二十四畿寰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}